Chapter: PunctualFastMath
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Punctual chapter FastMath

 FastMath called bit-clz without citing BitOps, so the chapter
 resolved only inside units that happened to cite BitOps themselves
 (punctual-quire does) and failed alone with CDX3002 -- the shape
 7.20's sweep caught. This unit cites FastMath and nothing else from
 the quire, so the chapter's own cites must resolve every name it
 uses.

 We say:

Section: Entry
  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 1: " & show (int-log2 1))
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 256: " & show (int-log2 256))
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 1023: " & show (int-log2 1023))
    print-line-uni ("int-log2 0: " & show (int-log2 0))
  end
